Dear Future Partner,

My name is Ella Novak, I got your email address from your=20
country's yellow page directory. I am a Polish lady from Poland=20
but I live in the UK. I work offshore as a marine engineer. As I=20
navigate the world's oceans, I've come to realize that there's=20
something missing in my life - someone to share my adventures=20
with. A bit about me, I'm a 39 year old Polish woman with a=20
passion for the sea and a love for life. I've been working as a=20
marine engineer for over 7 years, and I've had the privilege of=20
traveling to many exciting destinations around the world. When=20
I'm not on offshore you can find me exploring new places, trying=20
new foods, or practicing yoga to stay balanced. I'm looking for=20
someone who is kind, genuine, and adventurous. If you're a fellow=20
marine engineer or someone who loves the ocean, that's a plus!=20
But most importantly, I want to find someone who values honesty,=20
respect, and trust. I believe that a strong partnership is built=20
on these foundations, and I'm excited to find someone to share my=20
life with. As a marine engineer, my schedule can be=20
unpredictable, and I may be away from home for extended periods.=20
But I am ready to resign and look for another job that can give=20
me time to take good care of my man if I see someone that I can=20
call my own. I'm looking for someone who is understanding,=20
supportive, and patient.

If you're interested in getting to know me better, I'd love to=20
hear from you. Please feel free to reach out to me via email or=20
send me your Whatsapp number for easy communication. I've=20
included some photos of myself and my life as a marine engineer,=20
so you can get a glimpse into my world and also I will send you=20
more pictures if we get to know each other better. Thank you for=20
taking the time to read my letter. I look forward to hearing from=20
you and starting a new adventure together! I wish you all the=20
best.

Ella Novak
